## Analytical Significance for PRIS Research

### For P3 (BFSI AI Governance Regulatory Parallelism, JEIM) and fsQCA — historical baseline
This document establishes the **"year zero" reference point** for the BFSI AI governance timeline: in 2017, AI was framed purely as a competitive/innovation opportunity with robo-advisors regulated under existing activity-based categories (no technology-specific rules). Useful as a contrast anchor against SEBI_12/SEBI_9 (2019, first mandatory AI/ML reporting) and RBI_FREE_AI_2025 (2025, first RBI AI governance framework) — demonstrating an 8-year evolution from "AI as innovation" to "AI as supervised risk."

